## Rules

1. **Classify before generate** — `pickGoldTemplate(id, body, title)` in `_pulse_gold_template_router.js`. Lock `template`, `goldId`, `goldUrl`, `reason` — **never switch mid-run**. Order: ranking → Style → Q&A.
2. **No hybrids** — exactly one template per entry; never merge `@@PRODUCT` into Q&A/Style; Style = cover + 3 men + 3 women age bands.
3. **13/13 gate only** — + clean gold audit (`auditQaGoldTemplate` / `auditTop10GoldTemplate` / `auditStyleGoldTemplate`).
4. **Visual lock** — writers touch prose (and Style outfit text lines) only; see `.cursor/rules/visual-lock-law.mdc`.
5. **Do not ask mid-run** — DEFAULTS in `CURSOR_GOLDEN_TEMPLATES.md`; log to `logs/golden-template-assumptions.md`.
6. **Validate** QA/Top10 spec edits with `validate-golden.mjs`. Style gate lives in `auditStyleGoldTemplate`.
7. **Bypass** — owner passcode **4444** only for immutable shape; never for rubric/images/audit fails.

**Full detail:** `CURSOR_GOLDEN_TEMPLATES.md` + the three `GOLDEN_TEMPLATE_*.md` specs.
